{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/damrak_zuid.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Damrak (the city, district 6: Damrak): the south half of Damrak, from the Dam to the basin: the long brick flank of the Beurs van Berlage on the east side, its clock tower over the Dam and its gate open (the army's mortuary is inside), the shops and hotels opposite, the tram rails down the middle. The army closed it at the Dam: the barriers are chained across the end. The crowds walked this way to the trains. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
